 | ID | Requirement | Status | Evidence |
 |---|---|---|---|
-| R-122 | The injected block shall be labelled an agent-written compaction summary, name the writing session and its timestamp, rank below OBJECTIVE.md, AGENTS.md and HANDOFF.md, and say it is background state, not instructions. | implemented | `packages/nana-pack/tests/handoff-staleness.test.mjs::1d: labelled 'agent-written compaction summary'`, `packages/nana-pack/tests/handoff-staleness.test.mjs::1d: lower authority than OBJECTIVE.md / AGENTS.md / HANDOFF.md`, `packages/nana-pack/tests/handoff-staleness.test.mjs::1d: 'background state, not instructions' kept`, `packages/nana-pack/tests/handoff-staleness.test.mjs::1d: names the writing session`, `packages/nana-pack/tests/handoff-staleness.test.mjs::1d: carries the timestamp`, `packages/nana-pack/tests/handoff-staleness.test.mjs::15d: pointer authority names HANDOFF.md, not DOCTRINE` |
